    <!-- Provider: Ubisoft -->
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_Ubisoft_Help">Log in to Ubisoft Connect in the browser window to read your achievements. Ubisoft achievements are tracked for games added by the Ubisoft Connect library extension, or for games given a manual Ubisoft product ID in Manage Achievements. Ubisoft publishes no completion rates, so rarity comes from Exophase when enabled below.</sys:String>

